{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_ex01",
  "title": "声东击西",
  "storyCode": "RI-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9f8120eeac3d4c50ab897c6d7ef9913d4df9d651bb15540097cf5d965cf4653f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "烈日，荒野，黄沙，热风！wohoo！新的歌曲在我的心中诞生了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你们两个太吵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "确实。难得有这么空旷又无人的环境，不用担心被追赶的事，就不能安静地休息一会吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "不过，Alty，这里也能闻到海的气息，真的安全吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Aya，你真是一如既往的不解风情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "这片大地上没有安全的地方，但我们总要学会给自己放松一下，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "或许你是对的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "所以下一步，我们要用什么拓宽前进的道路？总不能再空手而归了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "至少，这次那个医生已经给了我们答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alty看了看手中的“钥匙”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "真的吗真的吗？这个东西看上去可不普通，她居然愿意把这个东西给你？你拿啥换的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "知识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "知识与这东西是等价的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我也不清楚，不过我觉得医生她是在催促我们去运用这个知识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "她会不知道这些吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我们知道多少，她应该就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "......仔细想想，真正的交易内容，应该是用我们的好奇心换来了我们的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "这，她不是啥都没出吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "被骗了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不，应该说是被诱导了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "被指挥了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "被指引了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "当真有这么重要吗，这个医生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不重要。我觉得这个医生正是想告诉我们，她的举动并不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "重要的是我们怎么想，怎么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "那钥匙呢？我们要去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "啊，很麻烦。能不能不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想这就和音乐一样......我们不应该拥有一种可以强制改变别人的力量，我们只是唱自己的歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "唱给他们听，如果好听——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那他们也会唱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "哈，那就把更多的知识和钥匙都交给准备好了的人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "会是谁呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "还不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "说不定还没出生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那太好了，但愿他还没出生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "别期待这种事情，Dan，我们......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "怎么了，Alty。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "车没能量了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你没有准备吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "准备了，但我们之前绕路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "而且，我必须承认，在这种没有公路也没有道标的荒野上行驶，很容易丧失方向感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "也就是说，我们迷路了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不能完全这么说，在大方向上，我们并没有偏离，只能说我们在开辟新的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "迷路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "迷路！这也是个不错的题材。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "不得不说，Dan，我有时候真想学学你的乐观。那怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "那个方向好像有一片雨林，我们去那边看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "那，谁来推车？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "或许我们可以轮流来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我们周边已经聚集了不少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "但我们听不懂他们的语言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "所以就这样让他们跟着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你有更好的方法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "把他们全都解决掉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "如果你能说服Frost和Dan的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（弹唱）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "&*......%￥......&（这、这是什么声音，为什么会这么好听？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "&%......%（我从没听过这样的声音......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "嗨，你们好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "你们说的是什么语言啊，可以告诉我吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "啊，虽然你们说了我也不会知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "......%&￥（这些人是哪里来的？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人D",
      "text": "￥......&#（这家伙怎么长得这么奇怪？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，至少这里有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "如果这里有能让我们补给的地方就更好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我认为你在做梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你们是外乡人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嗯？你说的是萨尔贡语？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯，看来你们确实是外乡人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你们为什么来这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我们的车耗尽了能量，所以一路来到这里想要找一些懂源石技艺的人帮我们补充一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......跟我来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你看，Aya，这不是出现了希望吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，这片大地真是无奇不有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "喂喂喂，喂喂喂喂喂，怎么回事，怎么回事啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "在这样一片原始的雨林里，竟然有这样一座村庄！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（哼唱）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "确实令人吃惊，大部分的建筑都有现代建筑的影子，但也保留了原始的美感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "很古怪，但也很独特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我是这个部族的族长，祖玛玛，我的部族的人大部分都能听懂你们说的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我可以安排一些部族祭司给你们的交通工具补充能量，但是我有条件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "什么样的条件？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我想看一看你们的车的内部构造。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "......就这样就可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你确定你不会把我们的车搞坏吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "应该不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想我们并没有多少选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "所以？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我们同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "好。大祭司爷爷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "来了！......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "你们是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "你是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "没想到在这里能遇到你这样的存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，不瞒你们说，我也是这么想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "不过比起你们，我还是对你们的车更加好奇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "请便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我要重复一下刚才的话，这片大地真是无奇不有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我难得同意你的意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这时，frost把吉他接上了祭祀用的音响，开始了一段即兴独奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不错啊，Frost。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "这座奇特的村庄给了我灵感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好帅啊，Frost，这次的旋律还加入了一些变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "炽热，压抑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "我把这段曲子，取名为......《D》！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "哪里来的声音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "这是什么声音？我感觉我浑身都充满了力量！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "好像是刚才来的外乡人！快去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "人越来越多了，Alty......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不妙哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "这些生命在渴望音乐！渴望力量！渴望......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "这个声音是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "外乡人啊，请留下更多的声音！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty......虽然很突然，不过我觉得现在的氛围也很适合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "干脆把我们的音响搬出来，一起上去演奏一曲吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "总之我不反对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好啊好啊，可不能让Frost一个人抢了风头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "这么劲爆的编曲，我不参一脚怎么行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "那就让这里的人感受我们的AUS的音乐吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "为什么只是一些声音，我却兴奋得停不下来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "这难道和祭司们用的祭乐一样，是所谓的“乐曲”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "我从没听过这样的乐曲！她们究竟是什么人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人D",
      "text": "我知道了，她们一定是“奎卡亚提”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "“奎卡亚提”？这是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，这是他们的语言中对“唱歌的人”的称呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "这里已经很久没有出现过“奎卡亚提”了，你们的音乐征服了她们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "虽然我不得不说，你们的音乐和我过去听过的奎卡亚提的音乐完全不一样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "但是没有关系，我觉得你们的音乐更加有趣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人E",
      "text": "“奎卡亚提”，再给我们演奏一曲吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人F",
      "text": "你们想要什么都可以，再来一曲吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "怎么办，Alty？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "留下来吧，Alty！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "虽然我想提醒你们不要忘记我们的目标......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "不过，好吧，我们有的是时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "没想到这里还有信使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "我也没想到只在杂志上见过的AUS竟然会来到这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "祖玛玛呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "她在制造你们想要的音响，所以由我来给你带路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "你们打算在这里待多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "也许是一周，也许是一个月，也许是一年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "这里点燃了我们，那我们至少要在这里尽兴才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "那么这里应该更加适合你们演出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "好酷的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "这里是......某种神庙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "没错，这里过去是所有部族聚集在一起举办“玛维索提亚”的地方，不过自从嘉维尔离开后，已经很久没有用过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "“玛维索提亚”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "嘉维尔？我好像在罗德岛上看过这个名字......算了，应该只是同名吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "你们可以在这里进行你们的演出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "让这里的人享受最好的音乐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "哈哈，没错，在这里留下属于AUS的痕迹吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两个月后"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "AUS真是一些不可思议的家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "竟然就真的在这里停留了两个月。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "这下嘉维尔要是哪天回来的话恐怕会大吃一惊吧，这样一个偏僻的地方，竟然也出现了音乐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "这里的人竟然爱上了摇滚乐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "那么，今天她们又打算带来什么样的演出呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "......说不定最狂热的是我自己也说不定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "AUS的各位......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房间是空的，各种生活用品和被褥也都摆放整齐，中央的简易桌子上，放着一张纸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "难道她们离开了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "桌上的这封信，我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "“我们走了，勿念。愿音乐能带给你们欢乐。还有，我们把我们的唱片全都留在了这里，尽情享受吧。——AUS”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "text": "......呵，真是一群不可思议的家伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "我想我不会忘记这个叫做阿卡胡拉的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（哼唱）一次难忘的经历。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "但是这里的人还是太吵了，而且太野蛮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "是吗？我很喜欢啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "你当然喜欢，我觉得把你留在那里你也不会反对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我确实犹豫了很久诶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "你们不觉得这里的人拥有一种天然的、原始的活力吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我们已经去过很多国家很多城市了，但是没有一个地方的人是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "我喜欢他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "好吧，这一点我确实无法否认。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "他们理解了我们的音乐，他们是最棒的听众。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "看来Frost也很中意他们呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "可不该把别人的生活搅得天翻地覆。只要唱歌就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "唱给他们听，如果好听——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "那他们也会唱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "我们是不是说过一样的话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "谁知道呢，我们或许说过无数次同样的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "走吧，我们该继续我们的旅途了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "把歌声唱给这片大地，他会倾听吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几个人在车上，开了个玩笑就结束了。\nAlty看着手中的钥匙，凯尔希医生啊，你们罗德岛能给这片大地想要的答案吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
